  "editor_review": "Prepare for an exhilarating journey in Ulala: Idle Adventure, the idle MMORPG set in the prehistoric era! With its engaging and social gameplay, Ulala captures the essence of the Stone Age. Whether you're a laid-back gamer or a dedicated player, Ulala provides a chill RPG experience that doesn't require you to be glued to the screen. Automatically advance your characters and pets, join forces with friends for extra rewards, and pick from a wide array of skills, gear, and customizations to shape your unique play style. And remember to have your favorite pet by your side to assist in battle!",
